{"3631070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Breaking Beaver", "steam_appid": 3631070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/6c757a8fc484196a8a0c62207134e9af.poster.avif?t=1779111599\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/6c757a8fc484196a8a0c62207134e9af.webm?t=1779111599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/6c757a8fc484196a8a0c62207134e9af.mp4?t=1779111599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>“I am the danger! I am the one who knocks down buildings!” — Marvin the “Breaking Beaver”</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO DAMS TO GIVE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaking Beaver is a fast-paced Survivor-like action game where you pilot a heavily armored bulldozer and tear through the city that took everything from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rip down buildings to reshape the battlefield, forging new paths through the chaos. Each building yields vital resources like wood, scrap, and cash, which you’ll use to enhance your bulldozer’s defensive and offensive capabilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to earn experience, leveling up to choose upgrades for both your weapons and your bulldozer, becoming more powerful with each choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/b29127be8e6181882528f8e97375763e.poster.avif?t=1779111599\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/b29127be8e6181882528f8e97375763e.webm?t=1779111599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/b29127be8e6181882528f8e97375763e.mp4?t=1779111599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CITY TO BURN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no “bad part” of Grove City. It’s all bad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a branching mission map with varying objectives and escalating difficulty modifiers. Each district raises the stakes, offering greater risks and greater rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete each mission’s objectives while surviving endless hordes of foes to advance. You can choose to escape immediately, or stick around to earn more resources and upgrades – at the risk of getting overwhelmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the final district and defeat the boss to complete the run, gaining resources to unlock permanent upgrades that persist between runs. Keep your loot, or risk advancing to the next difficulty tier, facing greater challenges and new bosses for greater gains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/d715ea874706ce45a694bfebb57ce6d2.poster.avif?t=1779111599\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/d715ea874706ce45a694bfebb57ce6d2.webm?t=1779111599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/d715ea874706ce45a694bfebb57ce6d2.mp4?t=1779111599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A RAGTAG WRECKING CREW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone needs a partner in crime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete in-run challenges to unlock a roster of 10 playable animal pilots, each with their own starting abilities and distinct playstyles. Expand your arsenal with dozens of unlockable weapons, and craft powerful synergies that transform your bulldozer into a relentless force of devastation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a run, recruit an animal copilot to unlock game-changing abilities that can save you from the brink of defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/d34d9d459a5fac01221a9eac17b12171.poster.avif?t=1779111599\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/d34d9d459a5fac01221a9eac17b12171.webm?t=1779111599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/d34d9d459a5fac01221a9eac17b12171.mp4?t=1779111599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a</strong> <strong>bulldozer-driving beaver</strong> waging a campaign of wanton destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demolish buildings </strong>to reshape the battlefield: open paths, funnel enemies, control space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 playable animal pilots</strong>, each with distinct starting abilities and build potential</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching mission map</strong> with multiple objective types and dynamic difficulty modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique enemy types</strong> and a climactic boss encounter at the end of each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ upgrades and 50+ unlockable weapons</strong> to craft powerful synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>~30-minute high-intensity runs</strong> with escalating pressure and meaningful choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steamdeck and Controller friendly</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One REALLY angry beaver</strong></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/6c757a8fc484196a8a0c62207134e9af.poster.avif?t=1779111599\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/6c757a8fc484196a8a0c62207134e9af.webm?t=1779111599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/6c757a8fc484196a8a0c62207134e9af.mp4?t=1779111599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>“I am the danger! I am the one who knocks down buildings!” — Marvin the “Breaking Beaver”</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>NO DAMS TO GIVE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breaking Beaver is a fast-paced Survivor-like action game where you pilot a heavily armored bulldozer and tear through the city that took everything from you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rip down buildings to reshape the battlefield, forging new paths through the chaos. Each building yields vital resources like wood, scrap, and cash, which you’ll use to enhance your bulldozer’s defensive and offensive capabilities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to earn experience, leveling up to choose upgrades for both your weapons and your bulldozer, becoming more powerful with each choice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/b29127be8e6181882528f8e97375763e.poster.avif?t=1779111599\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/b29127be8e6181882528f8e97375763e.webm?t=1779111599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/b29127be8e6181882528f8e97375763e.mp4?t=1779111599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A CITY TO BURN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no “bad part” of Grove City. It’s all bad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate a branching mission map with varying objectives and escalating difficulty modifiers. Each district raises the stakes, offering greater risks and greater rewards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete each mission’s objectives while surviving endless hordes of foes to advance. You can choose to escape immediately, or stick around to earn more resources and upgrades – at the risk of getting overwhelmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the final district and defeat the boss to complete the run, gaining resources to unlock permanent upgrades that persist between runs. Keep your loot, or risk advancing to the next difficulty tier, facing greater challenges and new bosses for greater gains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/d715ea874706ce45a694bfebb57ce6d2.poster.avif?t=1779111599\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/d715ea874706ce45a694bfebb57ce6d2.webm?t=1779111599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/d715ea874706ce45a694bfebb57ce6d2.mp4?t=1779111599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A RAGTAG WRECKING CREW</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone needs a partner in crime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete in-run challenges to unlock a roster of 10 playable animal pilots, each with their own starting abilities and distinct playstyles. Expand your arsenal with dozens of unlockable weapons, and craft powerful synergies that transform your bulldozer into a relentless force of devastation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During a run, recruit an animal copilot to unlock game-changing abilities that can save you from the brink of defeat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/d34d9d459a5fac01221a9eac17b12171.poster.avif?t=1779111599\" width=780 height=218 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/d34d9d459a5fac01221a9eac17b12171.webm?t=1779111599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/extras/d34d9d459a5fac01221a9eac17b12171.mp4?t=1779111599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as a</strong> <strong>bulldozer-driving beaver</strong> waging a campaign of wanton destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demolish buildings </strong>to reshape the battlefield: open paths, funnel enemies, control space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 playable animal pilots</strong>, each with distinct starting abilities and build potential</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching mission map</strong> with multiple objective types and dynamic difficulty modifiers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique enemy types</strong> and a climactic boss encounter at the end of each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>100+ upgrades and 50+ unlockable weapons</strong> to craft powerful synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>~30-minute high-intensity runs</strong> with escalating pressure and meaningful choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steamdeck and Controller friendly</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One REALLY angry beaver</strong></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "They took his dam. Now he’s taking revenge! Use a heavily armored bulldozer and arsenal of weapons to plow through buildings and enemy hordes alike. Raze entire city blocks, recruit unstable animal accomplices, and choose the right upgrades to become unstoppable in this Survivor-like beaver rampage.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Japanese", "reviews": "“[Breaking Beaver] is a deeply charming action roguelite... Very polished, a lot of fun. Great job!”<br>GIGATANK3000<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/3cc0080353682681d54eabacc8b5d8c639f5b1d1/header.jpg?t=1779111599", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/ac5503bf8267d07b3fde754b0d5409561ece67d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779111599", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3631070/ac5503bf8267d07b3fde754b0d5409561ece67d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779111599", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> D